# Archive folders - old versions and backups
**/archive/
**/archive_*/

# Large cache files from R Markdown
**/*_cache/
*.RData

# Large HTML reports (can be regenerated)
code/*_dge_*.html
code/isoform_transition_*.html

# Linked external repos (canonical location is sibling, not nested)
nmd_orf_model_v5_4ct/

# Verification / pre-rewrite backup snapshots (regenerable; not source of truth)
